# Third-party licenses

The `streagit` binary and Docker image include the following Rust crates.
Their license texts are reproduced below. This file is generated by
`scripts/third-party-licenses.sh` (cargo-about) from `Cargo.lock`; do not
edit it by hand.

streagit itself is MIT licensed (`LICENSE`); the embedded `style.css`,
`logo.png` and `favicon.png` are from stagit (`LICENSE-stagit`).

The source code of every crate listed here, including `uluru` (MPL-2.0), is
available from crates.io at `https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>`.

